{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"环路空间"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"环路空间"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>另见"},{"Local":{"url":"环路空间(代数几何)","text":"环路空间 (代数几何)"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>设 "},{"Local":{"url":"无穷范畴","text":"$\\infty$-范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ 有终对象 $*$. 对于"},{"Local":{"url":"带基点对象","text":"带基点对象"}},{"Plain":" $x\\colon *\\to X$, 定义其<strong>环路空间</strong> $\\Omega X = \\Omega (X,x)$ 是如下拉回,\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n    {ccc}\r\n    \\Omega (X,x) &amp; \\to &amp; * \\\\\r\n    \\downarrow &amp; &amp; \\downarrow \\\\\r\n    * &amp; \\to &amp; X.\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}